{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PRODUCT PRICE — version personnalisable via les Réglages du thème
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
This component generates price list for a given product. It handles the rendering of both price, compare at price,
sale price and unit price.
 
Réglages du thème utilisés (voir settings_schema.json) — s'appliquent partout sur la boutique :
- settings.product_on_sale_accent   → couleur du prix promo (réglage déjà existant dans Colors > Product)
- settings.price_compare_color      → couleur du prix barré (nouveau, Colors > Product)
- settings.price_sale_bold          → mettre le prix promo en gras (nouveau, Product card > Price display)
- settings.price_compare_strikethrough → afficher ou non le trait barré (nouveau, Product card > Price display)
- settings.price_size_sm / _default / _lg → taille du texte du prix selon le contexte (nouveau, Product card > Price display)
- settings.price_font → police du prix : corps de texte, titres, ou générique sans-serif/serif/monospace (nouveau, Product card > Price display)
 
Ce fichier accepte aussi des paramètres "override_*" (voir plus bas) permettant à UN appel précis de
price-list (par exemple depuis le bloc Price de la page produit) de court-circuiter les réglages
globaux ci-dessus, sans les modifier pour le reste de la boutique.
 
Tant que ces réglages restent sur leurs valeurs par défaut, le rendu est identique à l'original
(sauf la couleur du prix promo, qui applique désormais explicitement "On sale accent" — un réglage
qui existait déjà dans votre thème mais qui n'était pas forcément garanti d'être utilisé ici).
 
********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************
 
* product: the product from which prices are rendered
* variant: if a variant is specified, then only the price from this variant is rendered (used in product details)
* line_item: if a line item is specified, then the price from this line item are rendered
* hide_unit_price: if set to true, unit pricing are hidden (this is useful for elements that are very size constrained)
* size: can be either "sm" or "lg". If none is passed it will use the standard size
* alignment: can be "center" to align the prices
* override_color / override_compare_color: force a color for this render call only (bypasses the global Theme setting)
* override_weight: "bold", "normal", or blank to use the global Theme setting
* override_strikethrough: "show", "hide", or blank to use the global Theme setting
* override_size: a pixel number (e.g. "26"), or blank to use the global Theme setting
* override_compare_size: a pixel number for the compare-at price specifically, or blank to fall back to override_size / the global Theme setting
* override_order: "sale_first" (default), "compare_first", or blank to use the global Theme setting
* override_font: "body", "heading", "sans-serif", "serif", "monospace", or blank to use the global Theme setting
{%- endcomment -%}
 
{%- liquid
  case size
    when 'lg'
      assign regular_price_classes = 'text-lg'
      assign on_sale_price_classes = 'text-lg text-on-sale'
      assign compare_at_price_classes = 'text-subdued'
      assign unit_price_classes = 'text-subdued'
      assign price_size_setting = settings.price_size_lg
      assign price_compare_size_setting = settings.price_compare_size_lg
 
    when 'sm'
      assign regular_price_classes = 'text-subdued text-sm'
      assign on_sale_price_classes = 'text-on-sale text-sm'
      assign compare_at_price_classes = 'text-subdued text-sm'
      assign unit_price_classes = 'text-subdued text-sm'
      assign price_size_setting = settings.price_size_sm
      assign price_compare_size_setting = settings.price_compare_size_sm
 
    else
      assign regular_price_classes = 'text-subdued'
      assign on_sale_price_classes = 'text-on-sale'
      assign compare_at_price_classes = 'text-subdued'
      assign unit_price_classes = 'text-subdued text-sm'
      assign price_size_setting = settings.price_size_default
      assign price_compare_size_setting = settings.price_compare_size_default
  endcase
 
  assign effective_size = override_size | default: price_size_setting
  assign effective_compare_size = override_compare_size | default: price_compare_size_setting | default: effective_size
 
  if override_strikethrough == 'show'
    assign show_strikethrough = true
  elsif override_strikethrough == 'hide'
    assign show_strikethrough = false
  else
    assign show_strikethrough = settings.price_compare_strikethrough
  endif
 
  if show_strikethrough
    assign compare_at_price_classes = compare_at_price_classes | append: ' line-through'
  endif
 
  assign effective_weight = override_weight | default: settings.price_sale_weight | default: '400'
 
  assign effective_font = override_font | default: settings.price_font
 
  case effective_font
    when 'heading'
      assign price_font_family = settings.heading_font.family | append: ', ' | append: settings.heading_font.fallback_families
    when 'sans-serif'
      assign price_font_family = 'sans-serif'
    when 'serif'
      assign price_font_family = 'serif'
    when 'monospace'
      assign price_font_family = 'monospace'
    else
      assign price_font_family = settings.text_font.family | append: ', ' | append: settings.text_font.fallback_families
  endcase
 
  assign sale_color = override_color | default: settings.product_on_sale_accent
  assign compare_color = override_compare_color | default: settings.price_compare_color
 
  assign effective_order = override_order | default: settings.price_order | default: 'sale_first'
  assign price_list_extra_style = ''
 
  if effective_order == 'compare_first'
    assign sale_order = '2'
    assign compare_order = '1'
    assign price_list_extra_style = 'display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:0.35em;'
  else
    assign sale_order = '1'
    assign compare_order = '2'
  endif
 
  capture sale_price_style
    echo 'color: ' | append: sale_color | append: ';'
    echo 'font-family: ' | append: price_font_family | append: ';'
    echo 'font-weight: ' | append: effective_weight | append: ';'
    if effective_size != blank
      echo 'font-size: ' | append: effective_size | append: 'px;'
    endif
    echo 'order: ' | append: sale_order | append: ';'
  endcapture
 
  capture regular_price_style
    echo 'font-family: ' | append: price_font_family | append: ';'
    if effective_size != blank
      echo 'font-size: ' | append: effective_size | append: 'px;'
    endif
  endcapture
 
  capture compare_price_style
    echo 'font-family: ' | append: price_font_family | append: ';'
    if compare_color != blank
      echo 'color: ' | append: compare_color | append: ';'
    endif
    if effective_compare_size != blank
      echo 'font-size: ' | append: effective_compare_size | append: 'px;'
    endif
    echo 'order: ' | append: compare_order | append: ';'
  endcapture
-%}
 
<price-list class="price-list {% if size == 'lg' %}price-list--lg{% endif %} {% if text_alignment == 'center' %}justify-center{% endif %}" style="{{ price_list_extra_style }}">
  {%- if variant != blank -%}
    {%- comment -%}
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    VARIANT CASE (used on product page, quick view...)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <sale-price class="{% if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price %}{{ on_sale_price_classes }}{% else %}{{ regular_price_classes }}{% endif %}" style="{% if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price %}{{ sale_price_style }}{% else %}{{ regular_price_style }}{% endif %}">
      <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
 
      {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
        {{- variant.price | money_with_currency -}}
      {%- else -%}
        {{- variant.price | money -}}
      {%- endif -%}
    </sale-price>
 
    {%- if variant.compare_at_price > variant.price -%}
      <compare-at-price class="{{ compare_at_price_classes }}" style="{{ compare_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
 
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- variant.compare_at_price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- variant.compare_at_price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </compare-at-price>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- elsif line_item != blank -%}
    {%- comment -%}
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    LINE ITEM CASE (used on cart, order page...)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <sale-price class="{% if line_item.original_line_price > line_item.final_line_price %}{{ on_sale_price_classes }}{% else %}{{ regular_price_classes }}{% endif %}" style="{% if line_item.original_line_price > line_item.final_line_price %}{{ sale_price_style }}{% else %}{{ regular_price_style }}{% endif %}">
      <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
 
      {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
        {{- line_item.final_line_price | money_with_currency -}}
      {%- else -%}
        {{- line_item.final_line_price | money -}}
      {%- endif -%}
    </sale-price>
 
    {%- if line_item.original_line_price > line_item.final_line_price -%}
      <compare-at-price class="{{ compare_at_price_classes }}" style="{{ compare_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
 
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- line_item.original_line_price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- line_item.original_line_price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </compare-at-price>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%}
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    PRODUCT CASE (used on card)
    --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- if product.price_varies and product.compare_at_price -%}
      {%- assign cheapest_variant = product.variants | sort: 'price' | first -%}
 
      {%- capture price_min -%}
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- cheapest_variant.price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- cheapest_variant.price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
 
      {%- if cheapest_variant.price < cheapest_variant.compare_at_price -%}
        <sale-price class="{{ on_sale_price_classes }}" style="{{ sale_price_style }}">
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
          {{- 'product.price.from_price_html' | t: price_min: price_min -}}
        </sale-price>
 
        <compare-at-price class="{{ compare_at_price_classes }}" style="{{ compare_price_style }}">
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
 
          {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
            {{- cheapest_variant.compare_at_price | money_with_currency -}}
          {%- else -%}
            {{- cheapest_variant.compare_at_price | money -}}
          {%- endif -%}
        </compare-at-price>
      {%- else -%}
        <sale-price class="{{ regular_price_classes }}" style="{{ regular_price_style }}">
          <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
          {{- 'product.price.from_price_html' | t: price_min: price_min -}}
        </sale-price>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- elsif product.price < product.compare_at_price -%}
      <sale-price class="{{ on_sale_price_classes }}" style="{{ sale_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
 
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- product.price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- product.price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </sale-price>
 
      <compare-at-price class="{{ compare_at_price_classes }}" style="{{ compare_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.regular_price' | t }}</span>
 
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- product.compare_at_price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- product.compare_at_price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </compare-at-price>
    {%- elsif product.price_varies -%}
      {%- capture price_min -%}
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{ product.price_min | money_with_currency }}
        {%- else -%}
          {{ product.price_min | money }}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
 
      {%- capture price_max -%}
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- product.price_max | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- product.price_max | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endcapture -%}
 
      <sale-price class="{{ regular_price_classes }}" style="{{ regular_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
        {{- 'product.price.from_price_html' | t: price_min: price_min, price_max: price_max -}}
      </sale-price>
    {%- else -%}
      <sale-price class="{{ regular_price_classes }}" style="{{ regular_price_style }}">
        <span class="sr-only">{{ 'product.price.sale_price' | t }}</span>
 
        {%- if settings.currency_code_enabled -%}
          {{- product.price | money_with_currency -}}
        {%- else -%}
          {{- product.price | money -}}
        {%- endif -%}
      </sale-price>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
 
  {%- unless hide_unit_price -%}
    {%- assign unit_price_item = variant | default: line_item | default: product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}
 
    {%- if unit_price_item.unit_price -%}
      <unit-price class="{{ unit_price_classes }}">
        {%- assign unit_price_measurement = unit_price_item.unit_price_measurement -%}
 
        {%- if unit_price_measurement.reference_value != 1 -%}
          {%- assign reference_value = unit_price_measurement.reference_value -%}
        {%- endif -%}
 
        ({{ unit_price_item.unit_price | money }}/{{ reference_value }}{{ unit_price_measurement.reference_unit }})
      </unit-price>
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endunless -%}
</price-list>